---
title: Creating a user
endpoint: /users
method: post
---

Use this endpoint to invite a teammate to your newsletter.

You'll need your [primary API key](/api-authentication) and write access to newsletter settings. Other API keys can't invite teammates, even if they have write access to newsletter settings.

You can only give a teammate permissions you have yourself. For example, if you can read subscribers but can't edit them, you can give your teammate `subscriber: read`, but not `subscriber: write`.

If you use any API key other than your primary API key or try to give someone more access than you have, you'll receive a `403` with the code `permission_denied`. Buttondown won't send an invitation or give them access.
